    {
      "id": "410f6b28-a474-43f5-b9da-b30e4c7fd1d1",
      "content": "English: Twelve (the) | French: Douze | Latin: Duodecim | Origin: &#916;&#969;&#948;&#949;&#954;&#945; | Vietnamese: Nhóm Mười Hai -- Mt 20,17",
